# Build context for stakecore/Dockerfile: an allow-list, because the repository
# root also holds reviews, the book, Windows tooling and a protoc.exe.
#
# What is let through is the zebra-crosslink workspace plus every sibling one of
# its manifests reaches with a `../` path. A new sibling upstream adds shows up as
# a cargo "failed to read .../Cargo.toml" at the start of the build, not an hour in.
*

!zebra-crosslink
!wallet
!librustzcash
!zebra-gui
!clay-rs
!tenderlink
!patches
# zebra-gui's build script resolves ../packaging/icons (only read on Windows).
!packaging

**/target
**/.git
